plication/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"c553e14e9322c3b4bfc3c7bbb362cbc5c596ad783f0e88499428a544f8ad6092","event_uuid":"a7619728-8f31-4fd3-9bd4-e6aa01b1008c","position":{"commit_sha":"722e06eded79f851da2aeee60412559524cf28bd","position":"1788620304546019922-a7619728-8f31-4fd3-9bd4-e6aa01b1008c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"0b1bcad8f268166a36f5e63586fa67df91dfc56b61888fef277866422fa1a33c","event_uuid":"bf981571-8f3f-4a81-a9c6-161c536f498e","position":{"commit_sha":"a039e81f0b595d9c34cb182dffa2b62805c4faa1","position":"1788621029823505001-bf981571-8f3f-4a81-a9c6-161c536f498e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"6aab1b260b5d61bd15c5eb991674e27620016d501eda6c659feca2763bb09499","event_uuid":"8405bbd7-09ea-4843-b68b-3cf79ff5182a","position":{"commit_sha":"8feabdc1b328a0c653d09a486067965125d567ee","position":"1788621416666844077-8405bbd7-09ea-4843-b68b-3cf79ff5182a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"3597cb8a78848961a2892bd5650c16e626f557a8a85ffd7f3f2b7cd9d93230f2","event_uuid":"40d58e2d-42ac-41a2-abe6-69f87e74756a","position":{"commit_sha":"2f5b5e676500f1432cabe1b82cf6ab5f1a9c2ff2","position":"1788621744468459126-40d58e2d-42ac-41a2-abe6-69f87e74756a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Kickoff: execute 114 grouped comment-remediation leaves under 6 stories, one independently reviewed and landed Gerrit change per leaf. Rebar MCP reads succeeded, but create_ticket later returned empty without writing; tracker writes therefore use the repo-local CLI fallback and bug skaldic-carbon-copperhead records the failure. Isolated worktree /Users/joeoakhart/comment-remediation-3e32 is at current origin/main. Initial make worktree provisioning exposed foliated-correct-arcticfox; provisioning was completed with the repository-pinned uv 0.12.7. Work is comment/docstring-only: preserve current non-obvious rationale and constraints, make no executable or assertion changes, verify every diff row-by-row plus ticket/project gates, fetch and integrate origin/main between tickets and immediately before every push, land and close each leaf before advancing, then close stories and epic bottom-up.","timestamp":1788584714944116001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan gate milestone: goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle first passed with one P6 advisory for compound acceptance criteria. Split preserve-item, consumer-contract, executable-behavior, and assertion outcomes; re-review passed clean and signed at 25d1d683e55a. Updated the delivery story and epic descriptions to independently verifiable criteria and to encode the user-required per-ticket Gerrit/main/close ordering. First delivery-story review was not admitted: GATE_CONGESTED, all 4 host slots in use; no verdict. Will retry later without force.","timestamp":1788586085751022001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Resumed at current `origin/main` `070c54e6f0ff34577c3cb66632d57387f7bddf7d` (clean fast-forward from `25d1d683e55a`). The latest delivery-story review BLOCKED on G6 because Scope preservation relied on self-authored completion comments and the migration TSV checked only path structure. Remediation is now durable: all 11 delivery leaves record an executable comment-only diff guard, per-path `git diff --check`, and `make lint`; `dendritic-irksome-raven` now requires a separate non-author reviewer to produce a leaf-linked item-by-item before/after TSV for every constraint, consumer contract, and edited comment block. Exact-string equality is explicitly excluded so concise semantic rewording remains valid. Next gate: re-review the delivery story, then the epic, claim the valid chain, and execute `goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle`.","timestamp":1788590537120397001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review milestone: `keen-alkylic-heifer` now has a signed, current, clean PASS at `a33333b8709a73b94d48dca6f9b9f42e562519f8` (no blocking, advisory, coaching, or dropped findings). The initial PASS exposed two accurate out-of-directory consumers of `bedrock.toml`; the plan now preserves both the matrix-only `deliberately blanks ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` phrase and the `take new IDs VERBATIM` instruction, with `rebar.toml`, `docs/local-dev-env.md`, ADR 0059, compose, and provider-pin tests enumerated as consumers. This representative review confirms the executable preservation commands satisfy G6.","timestamp":1788592642667189001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review milestone: `verminous-zealous-krill` received a signed clean PASS at `a33333b8709a73b94d48dca6f9b9f42e562519f8` with no blocking, advisory, coaching, dropped, or indeterminate findings. Its plan now keeps visible pull-request guidance out of the terse-comment scope, limits remediation to the hidden routing comment, and enumerates CodeQL/Dependabot cross-file consumers.","timestamp":1788593091448315001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review milestone: `classy-bicolor-owl` received a signed clean PASS at `a33333b8709a73b94d48dca6f9b9f42e562519f8` with no findings. Delivery leaves currently certified: `goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle`, `keen-alkylic-heifer`, `verminous-zealous-krill`, and `classy-bicolor-owl` (4/11).","timestamp":1788593635143772001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review milestone: `awestruck-starchy-cowbird` received a signed clean PASS at `a33333b8709a73b94d48dca6f9b9f42e562519f8` with no findings. Delivery leaves currently certified: 5/11 (`goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle`, `keen-alkylic-heifer`, `verminous-zealous-krill`, `classy-bicolor-owl`, `awestruck-starchy-cowbird`).","timestamp":1788594064986281001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit workflow preflight: authenticated account groups are Registered Users, user/Rebar Bot Nava, Contributors, and Anonymous Users; `feature-branch-drivers` is absent. Recent owner:self merged history on `main` includes changes 2664, 2662, 2663, 2658, 2661, 2660, 2659, 2657, 2645, and 2656, confirming ordinary review/Submit rights. Per AGENTS.md's fallback and the user's explicit per-child landing request, this epic will send each independently reviewable leaf to `refs/for/main`, wait for `LLM-Review +1` and `Verified +1`, submit, confirm `origin/main`, then advance before the next leaf; it will not attempt the feature-branch driver path.","timestamp":1788594171423530001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2026-09-05: Reconfirmed uv diagnostic bug foliated-correct-arcticfox on origin/main c0199203 and added current evidence. Re-audited bitumen-canophilic-pekingese against current compose contracts; corrected false non-root claims, expanded preservation scope, and recorded focused infra verification. Filed discovered docs drift as edible-insane-mongrel (docs/gerrit-aws-setup.md), linked discovered_from the compose leaf.","timestamp":1788595107328618001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2026-09-05 checkpoint: fetched and fast-forwarded the execution worktree to origin/main 0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e. Reconfirmed uv/worktree diagnostic bug foliated-correct-arcticfox on that commit and recorded the recurrence; MCP show_ticket remained unserved on two attempts, so local CLI fallback was used and the recurrence was added to existing bug skaldic-carbon-copperhead. Corrected TypeIgnore normalization in fumbling-enervative-bats and taurine-tardy-kite manifests. Applied independent audits to congenial-cibophobic-goosefish, tan-goldenrod-drever, and seaisland-nonliteral-tigermoth: fixed stale/false contracts, consumers, scope, semantic-matrix AC, AST/directive guards, focused suites, and make verify manifests. No repository file has been edited and no implementation ticket has been claimed yet.","timestamp":1788607305327794001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Confirmed uv/worktree diagnostic remains present on origin/main@0033662b: repository requires uv ==0.12.7 while /opt/homebrew/bin/uv is 0.12.9, and the Makefile still maps any uv venv failure to the Python-provisioning message. Existing bug foliated-correct-arcticfox already covers the defect, so no duplicate was created. MCP show_ticket stalled and then returned HTTP 502 on retry; recorded the recurrence on skaldic-carbon-copperhead and used the local CLI fallback.","timestamp":1788615146955167001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-audit milestone on origin/main@0033662b: corrected proposed-nomophobic-piranha (added test_mcp.py; 14-path impact), unmelted-cosmic-eeve (omitted anchors and zero current xfail gaps), and subdivine-dimming-fieldmouse (166-block current allowlist, corrected run_bridge --only versus compatibility --filter-local-ids, real consumers, content-only guard). All three local fallback reviews returned PASS and signed current plan-review attestations. Also confirmed current certifications for omphacite-autoimmune-pygmy, restoring-cynical-woodborer, concise-extended-salmon, gimmicky-unlimited-rook, desired-private-skink, and capillary-seared-grackle. Accepted generic P6 compound-criterion advisories because each grouped clause is jointly decided by one named evidence artifact; editing would only invalidate otherwise-current PASS attestations.","timestamp":1788616227279245001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Batch audit completed against origin/main@50716c9aed87479e4347a4daf084c9778c8793f7 (no code edits; no plan reviews started):\n\n- strange-urological-cornsnake (8455-598a-8245-4f4b): 4 review_bot files, 5 stable prose blocks.\n- base-conscious-astarte (89eb-b9dc-6f1b-4b4c): 4 commands files, 22 stable prose blocks.\n- priceless-hotheaded-annelid (c540-7c26-f979-45d8): 4 store files, 22 stable prose blocks.\n- capable-moist-coot (744b-6822-b9a6-435a): 5 files, 5 stable prose blocks.\n\nAll descriptions now use stable docstring/comment-to-code anchors, immutable before/final type_comments=True AST comparison with only ast.TypeIgnore.lineno normalized, exact inline/directive preservation, and one independent-review TSV row per edited block with immutable citations plus semantic-preservation/bloat-removal PASS. Composite old ranges were split into distinct blocks. The stale terraform range 178-183 (now executable assertions) was replaced by the intended comment anchored before _CaptureRunner. Replay-corpus helper consumption by test_plan_replay_parity.py and platform-selection consumption from tests/conftest.py were recorded. File-impact sets were confirmed exact; each ticket now carries five executable verify commands. Tickets remain open, unassigned, and unsigned because all gate slots were occupied.","timestamp":1788618419847293001},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-repair ledger — 2026-09-05\n\nApplied the completed immutable-base audit to four open leaf tickets through the rebar MCP write surface:\n\n- cordial-vulpine-piglet: replaced the description with 29 stable prose anchors, implemented-link-sync correction, AST/directive/runtime rules, exact consumers, four protected directives, and a 29-row independent TSV contract; recorded 7 verify commands (semantic, directives, paths, diff, hygiene, focused, full).\n- misogynous-demonian-fly: replaced the description with the 167-block census (165 editable), stable reducer anchors, implemented-vs-RED corrections, exact directive list, and a 165-row TSV contract; recorded the same 7 command classes over all 16 files.\n- plastery-nonblack-centipede: replaced the description with the corrected 53-block census, all 14 drift additions, renamed cursor-based marker contract, runtime-stub exclusions, and a 53-row TSV contract; recorded 7 commands over the exact 18 paths. The first 8,841-character edit triggered the admission-cap warning and was immediately superseded by a 7,055-character equivalent with no warning.\n- bronze-unrelaxed-erne: replaced the description with four stable header/docstring anchors, no-raw-editor and 429/matching corrections, MJS tail/shebang/AST rules, consumers, and a four-row TSV contract; recorded 11 commands including exact wrapper nodes, cassette self-test, and one node --check per MJS file.\n\nEvery description distinguishes immutable prose basis origin/main@0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e from current implementation base 10533b1e3f651a60e8cea5691318c108ff1f3396, whose intervening changes are unrelated. One-commit HEAD^..HEAD guards compare changed paths with each unchanged file-impact set.\n\nRead-back confirmed: tickets remain open; file-impact counts remain 11/16/18/4; verify counts are 7/7/7/11; the retired 9e65567 pin is absent; no description warning remains. No plan review, code edit, claim, transition, close, or push was performed outside rebar's normal ticket-event auto-push.","timestamp":1788619184562031783},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Mutation ledger — 2026-09-05\n\nUpdated four open planning tickets through the rebar MCP tracker surface; no claim, transition, plan review, code edit, test execution, commit, or push was performed.\n\n- `linguistic-dental-eyra`: replaced description with the immutable `0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e` 60-block/11-path audit, corrected rotation/unblock scopes and consumers, rewrote all 11 file-impact reasons, and recorded 6 DD-labeled verify commands.\n- `easy-crabbed-avocet`: replaced description with the immutable 3-block/3-path audit, separated five executable offline workflow nodes from two collection-only live Jira nodes, rewrote all 3 reasons, and recorded 7 verify commands.\n- `improbable-crimson-hare`: replaced description with the immutable 74-block/18-path audit (correcting the unsupported 75 count), split broad scopes around inline prose/directives, rewrote all 18 reasons, and recorded 6 verify commands.\n- `syllabic-humoristic-tarantula`: replaced description with the immutable 91-block/12-path audit, corrected graph-perf drift and ownership/shim contracts, rewrote all 12 reasons, and recorded 6 verify commands.\n\nEach plan now defines stable symbol/code block IDs, immutable-base AST/runtime/directive/shebang comparison, exact leaf changed-path equality, independent one-row-per-block TSV review, focused checks, path-scoped diff integrity, and no-timeout worktree-venv `make verify`. The unrelated `origin/main` advance to `10533b1e3f651a60e8cea5691318c108ff1f3396` is explicitly excluded from audit identity. MCP readback confirmed every description, impact array, and verify-command array exactly; all writes reported push_status=ok with no description or cross-session warnings.","timestamp":1788619237248397301},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Mutation-ledger follow-up: hardened all four `immutable-prose-only` DD commands and matching description text so the immutable-base AST comparator removes only the allowlisted qualified-owner docstrings; non-allowlisted docstrings now remain in the AST and therefore fail on change. Final MCP readback again matched all four descriptions, all 44 path/reason rows, and all 25 structured verify commands exactly. All four tickets remain open; every write auto-pushed with no warning.","timestamp":1788619605662616541},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review milestone: certified autositic-scarlet-clam, highclass-cognizant-orca, keen-alkylic-heifer, verminous-zealous-krill, corrected 164-block subdivine-dimming-fieldmouse, congenial-cibophobic-goosefish, tan-goldenrod-drever, and seaisland-nonliteral-tigermoth. Started async MCP reviews for strange-urological-cornsnake, base-conscious-astarte, priceless-hotheaded-annelid, and capable-moist-coot. Worktree fast-forwarded cleanly to origin/main@10533b1e3f651a60e8cea5691318c108ff1f3396; later remote advances reported by auditors affect unrelated paths. No code work or claims have begun.","timestamp":1788620304546019922},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Second deterministic-plan audit batch — 2026-09-05\n\nRevalidated every owned blob against `origin/main@9e6a0e436520f67962c22dc244d7b4f77f5bee45` and updated four open leaves through the repo-local CLI fallback (rebar MCP unavailable):\n\n- `nonlineal-crotchety-galago` (`51fb-a3b6-ac66-4c60`): 7 files, 10 stable docstrings; five already-concise/load-bearing ranged comments are now explicitly protected.\n- `dripping-viperous-chickadee` (`a578-8751-ec4f-4369`): 9 files, 34 stable blocks; composite ranges were split/anchored, two concise rationale blocks protected, and post-audit Terraform files excluded from this legacy inventory.\n- `twofaced-oppressed-nurseshark` (`6f06-6920-8439-4642`): 13 files, 18 stable blocks; module-size helper consumption and its focused companion test are explicit.\n- `actinium-abominable-anole` (`4458-5aec-af9b-4534`): 18 files, 43 stable blocks; the vague `and held-out narration` scope became exact IDs, six concise/load-bearing blocks are protected, and current basetemp/close-precheck/run_shape contracts replace stale audit text.\n\nAll four descriptions now require immutable before/final `type_comments=True` AST comparison with only `ast.TypeIgnore.lineno` normalized, exact non-allowlisted comment/directive/runtime preservation, and one independent TSV row per edited block with immutable citations plus the three required PASS fields. Each ticket has five structured commands: focused pytest (including real source/path consumers), scoped Ruff check+format, comment hygiene, owned-path `git diff --check`, and worktree-venv `make verify`.\n\nReadback matched the prepared descriptions, exact file-impact sets, declared block counts (105 total), and command arrays. All four remain open, unassigned, and unsigned. No plan review, code edit, claim, transition, close, test/gate execution, commit, or push was performed.","timestamp":1788621029823505001},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Comment-remediation audit receipt — immutable base d49fea41cc383dc70d465903e94598a6dc790bd1; direct parent hopeful-deserved-needletail (d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6).\n\nSelection evidence: 22 direct children were enumerated. All were open, unassigned, and carried no attestation kind, so ranking was ascending file-impact count then alias. Selected exactly:\n- little-untimely-grison (ab62-e1a6-df62-42fa): 4 paths, 51 exact blocks — transition.py, txn.py, verify_authorship.py, verify_opcert.py.\n- outgoing-heavensent-sardine (ad60-37a0-2d1d-4688): 4 paths, 13 exact blocks — _io/_cli.py, _provenance.py, _strip.py, import_ndjson.py.\n- pale-despairful-pikeperch (c437-d221-8471-47a7): 4 paths, 42 exact blocks — reducer/_cache.py, _managed_refs.py, _processors_status.py, _processors.py.\n- cloudy-primitive-scaup (8c04-ae95-b307-450b): 5 paths, 36 exact blocks — _engine_support/reads.py, attest/authorship_resolution.py, graph/_links.py, opcert_service/app.py, opcert_service/workspace.py.\n\nPersisted per leaf: corrected sub-8k description, exact path set with path-specific reasons, and six structured command/DD records (immutable-prose-only, exact-leaf-paths, comment-hygiene, focused-contracts, diff-integrity, repository-gates). Material corrections: replaced older-SHA broad ranges with owner-qualified stable prose IDs; removed executable code, concise/load-bearing blocks, and all policy/lint directives from the allowlists; added missed long blocks throughout every declared path; recorded actual CLI/library/MCP/gate/reducer consumers; and explicitly excluded FastAPI endpoint docstrings consumed by OpenAPI. The AST oracles parse with type_comments=True, strip only allowlisted leading owner docstrings, normalize only TypeIgnore.lineno, compare remaining runtime AST, and require directive/shebang physical-line equality. No code edits, claims, reviews, transitions, commits, or pushes were performed.","timestamp":178862141